    ]
  },
  "sources": [
    "https://support.google.com/docs/answer/181110?hl=en&co=GENIE.Platform%3DDesktop"
  ],
  "note": "Current web editor, PC/ChromeOS and Mac columns. Where the vendor lists multiple alternate chords for one action, only the primary chord is recorded. 'Insert rows above' and 'Insert columns to the left' share the Ctrl+Alt+= 'open insert menu' shortcut with 'Delete rows'/'Delete columns' sharing Ctrl+Alt+-, so those are recorded once each as menu shortcuts rather than duplicated per direction. Mouse-only shortcuts are omitted.",
